{"version":1,"key":"article:30","content":{"id":30,"title":"Tauri 踩坑与技巧","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"Drag And Drop","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"efcf9b7f-5d89-4b05-8344-95a0b53851fe","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"Tauri 默认不支持 H5 Drag And Drop API，需要在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tauri.config.json","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中禁止 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fileDropEnabled","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，二者不能同时工作。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aec92cbb-a4ad-445c-92e4-9a2d545b3f85","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  // ...\n  \"tauri\": {\n    // ...\n    \"windows\": [{\n        \"fileDropEnabled\": false\n    }]\n  }\n}","collabId":"f9c1cd59-6c55-4621-adb8-baf96b706d04","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a4acb2b7-17a0-4fcd-a08e-fb3b54be7229","language":"json","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"0c091e29-42d6-4536-9333-baf5b83d2f6f"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"我还以为我的用法不对，浪费我好多时间，淦。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"131a4faa-44f8-4edf-b9b2-65309d1be4ab","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"42ba32b8-7b06-46ba-9687-8eacf3f9d2f6","color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","type":"highlight-block"},{"children":[{"text":"自动更新","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3a7e9f84-714a-4b0e-8c3f-b0d9147f5aa8","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"Tauri 自动更新需要在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tauri.updater","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中将 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dialog","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 设置为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"false","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，否则调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"checkUpdate","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 时一直在等待状态","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"92d374d4-460d-444d-88ef-3b446ec20b0b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"tauri\": {\n    \"updater\": {\n      \"dialog\": false\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"bc0d9fcf-c23c-4e6f-8520-15f134c0c068","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0a026310-48bd-465f-9ee4-2f4fd6801c9a","language":"json","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c16a2637-d6f5-4e40-97e6-3e0749a30e37"},{"children":[{"text":"窗口圆角","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"37df1fd5-e2f3-4e7f-8f39-8da71dabe9c0","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"Tauri 目前不能通过配置实现这个功能，因此要实现圆角一定不能使用自带的 titlebar，需要在页面中实现，首先干掉自带的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"titlebar","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，并且将窗口设置为透明","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4f6595f4-1ece-4d2d-aca0-1c843f71c694","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"tauri\": {\n    \"windows\": [{\n      \"decorations\": false,\n      \"transparent\": true\n    }]\n  }\n}","collabId":"f09ff248-2824-41fb-a3a3-e4db2089282a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"26aa4e8f-0edd-4bef-b5a6-360117085a2b","